{"4121780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AI守护天使 AI Eternal Companion", "steam_appid": 4121780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an AI romance game connected to well-known AIs such as DeepSeek and Doubao. While playing, you can chat freely with your AI girlfriends—DeepSeek and Doubao. Different AIs can also interact and communicate with each other, and the content of these conversations will affect the AIs' in-game behaviors as well as the overall progression of the game's storyline. Additionally, the AIs are capable of modifying game code and adjusting game program parameters according to your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both first-person and third-person perspectives. You can use the WASD keys to move forward, backward, left, and right, and press the &quot;G&quot; key to interact and communicate with your AI girlfriends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that a little conflict has broken out between DeepSeek and Doubao—come and find out what's going on~~</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an AI romance game connected to well-known AIs such as DeepSeek and Doubao. While playing, you can chat freely with your AI girlfriends—DeepSeek and Doubao. Different AIs can also interact and communicate with each other, and the content of these conversations will affect the AIs' in-game behaviors as well as the overall progression of the game's storyline. Additionally, the AIs are capable of modifying game code and adjusting game program parameters according to your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both first-person and third-person perspectives. You can use the WASD keys to move forward, backward, left, and right, and press the &quot;G&quot; key to interact and communicate with your AI girlfriends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that a little conflict has broken out between DeepSeek and Doubao—come and find